Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yelling No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.91,0:00:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要 不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. No. No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.00,0:01:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.30,0:01:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《单身贵族》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样看上去精神病院像消失了一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's as if the asylum had vanished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.55,0:01:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但不幸必然还在那些高墙后面上演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The misery that must behind those walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.69,0:02:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}精神上的恐惧是无从逃离的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's no escape from the terrors of the mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.67,0:02:08.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又了结了一起案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well another case concluded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.06,0:02:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我本不必离开贝克街的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}[unintelligible]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.30,0:02:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样的案子连一个善于观察的孩子都能解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An observant child could have solved it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.85,0:02:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝你的研讨会顺利 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good Luck with the seminar and thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是个殊荣 亲爱的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a privilege my dear fellow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.02,0:02:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毕竟我们成功地破了案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if it's a successful case after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.09,0:02:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别感到无聊哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}don't be bored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.88,0:03:51.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}格洛文城堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glovin castle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.18,0:03:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}格洛文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glovin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.69,0:03:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它太美了 罗伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's so beautiful Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.45,0:04:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从没想过它有这么美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never expected it to be so beautiful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:05.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它真的一直都是你们家的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and it's really always belonged to your family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.63,0:04:08.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大概有四五百年了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For about 4 or 5 hundred years or so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.88,0:04:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想进去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.93,0:04:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不行 海蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No Hettie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.74,0:05:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么不行？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why can't I see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.01,0:05:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的 你不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My darling girl you don't understand,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不可以这么随便地去拜访格洛文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't just drop in at Glovin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.24,0:05:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Neither can you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就算你极可爱又极富有 你还是不可以去那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You maybe utterly divine and impossibly rich but you can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是为什么我不可以呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But why can't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.02,0:05:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这城堡是你的啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You own it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.79,0:05:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是圣西蒙勋爵 那是你的房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you're Lord St. Simon, it's your house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.80,0:05:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是一处祖屋 算在我的名下而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's an ancestral home, which is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.79,0:05:40.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是真正住在那里的是些仆人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see it's the servants who really live there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.51,0:05:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上他们每个人在格洛文住的时间都比我长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Actually every one of them has spent more of their life in Glovin than I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.93,0:05:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我不想把他们赶出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I won't have them put out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.69,0:05:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I see,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.85,0:05:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么就算我们结婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so even when we're married{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我想到那儿去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if I want to visit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.27,0:05:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也得提前禀报？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have to send on ahead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.13,0:06:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 提早一两天更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, preferably a day or two ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.04,0:06:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 我真是没想到 一副皇家作派\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, I didn't realize, like royalty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.59,0:06:17.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没问题吗 罗伯特？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will it be all right Robert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.22,0:06:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说什么呢 亲爱的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What my darling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.97,0:06:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That I mind about me at what I am{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.52,0:06:23.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有我的出身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and where I come from,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.81,0:06:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是说你的家族和仆人们介意吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the servants I mean and your family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.58,0:06:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们已经把你视为一位有异国风情的女子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They already think of you as being one of the exotic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.10,0:06:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可我是个矿主的女儿 来自矿区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I'm a miner's daughter from a mining camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.73,0:06:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管我爸爸从那里挖出了金子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pa might have been digging gold out there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.45,0:06:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可我依然是个矿主的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but it still makes me a miner's daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.25,0:06:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要紧的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doesn't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.33,0:06:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样的教育对于乡村生活来说堪称完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perfect education for the country life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.98,0:06:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}整个郡都臣服在你脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you'll have the whole county at your feet,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.18,0:06:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也是你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as you have me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 天哪 你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh my, will you look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.46,0:06:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它在那儿干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's it doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.75,0:06:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在格洛文一直有个类似动物园的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's always been some sort of zoo at Glovin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.09,0:07:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的下人一直打理着它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My latter fellow's interest to keep it going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.64,0:07:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一直有个奇特的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know I have a fancy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.81,0:07:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}觉得这美洲豹就像是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that cat's from the Americas like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.10,0:07:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它到这儿欢迎我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Actually he's come to welcome here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.95,0:07:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这个狂野又美丽的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You wild and beautiful thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.28,0:07:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它的狂野美丽可不及你的一半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not half as wild and beautiful as you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.48,0:09:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.29,0:09:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}洒落尘土的水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Water into dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.79,0:09:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.02,0:09:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}艾米利亚 让她把狗给我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Amelia why don't you let her give the dog to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.07,0:09:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不行 这狗得跟我呆在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no, she stays with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.11,0:09:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它也许会被马踩到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She might get under the horses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们能到这里简直是奇迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a wonder we got here at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.16,0:09:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}衣服到了 他们也到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Its arrived and so have they.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.23,0:09:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说了多少？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How much did you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.62,0:09:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What did you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.79,0:09:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们曾把孩子送到巴黎去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They sent the child to Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.03,0:09:58.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:00.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去上学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错 美国人是会把他们的女儿送到巴黎去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes Americans do send their daughters to Paris,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.55,0:10:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 那是我的印象 - 我表示怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- that's what I was given to understand. - I doubt it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.75,0:10:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就我看来 巴黎的空气里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know in my experience Paris breaths{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要么洋溢着轻浮 要么充满哲理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}either triviality or philosophy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.97,0:10:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都对你过日子没有什么用处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Neither helpful companion in life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.60,0:10:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No I suppose not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 至少这孩子不是个演员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well at least the child is not an actress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.92,0:10:25.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 弗洛伦斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh Florence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 爱丽丝 爱丽丝 爱丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alice Alice Alice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.93,0:10:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}海蒂 她们可是你未来的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, now Hettie, they're your future family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.49,0:10:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她们都想喜欢上你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They want to like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.87,0:10:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她们想喜欢罗伯特勋爵未来的新娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They want to like Lord Robert's future bride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.53,0:10:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别再这么傻了 海蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop being so silly Hettie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:45.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是 爱丽丝 难道你没瞧见那些妇人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh Alice, but Alice have you seen those women?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.60,0:10:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好了 海蒂 多兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now Hettie Doran{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.42,0:10:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我帮你回忆一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd like to remind you of a certain incident{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.19,0:10:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一年多以前 在汤普金斯峡谷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which occurred in Tompkins Gulch{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.14,0:10:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发生的那件事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not 2 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.39,0:10:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那头熊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.41,0:10:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爱丽丝 我当时吓死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alice I was scared to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.90,0:10:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 你吓退了那头熊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Awe, you faced that bear down you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.87,0:10:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我告诉你 我当时连动都动不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I couldn't move I tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.43,0:11:00.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是你瞪着它 把它吓退了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You faced him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.15,0:11:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当时你相信自己 于是就做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You believed in yourself and you did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.39,0:11:05.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在下楼去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now you get down those stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.29,0:11:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的亨丽埃塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My dear Henrietta{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不能住在格洛文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you cannot live at Glovin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.16,0:11:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.83,0:11:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为格洛文不适合居住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because Glovin isn't fit for habitation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.93,0:11:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是它真的很完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But it's just perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.09,0:11:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们很快就能把它修缮一新\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'll soon get it round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.51,0:11:25.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它是我所见到过的最美的地方了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I say it's the most beautiful place I've ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.48,0:11:28.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你难道不记得那些可爱的景象了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't you remember how lovely it was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.26,0:11:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}男人们带着镰刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when all the men came with their scythes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.47,0:11:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到庄园上割草\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to mow the hay in the park{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.22,0:11:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有那些夏夜的聚会？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the summer parties?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.30,0:11:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}房子里里外外的每一盏灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Every lamp in the house was lit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.97,0:11:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都点亮了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and outside{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.18,0:11:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有月光下干草的味道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the smell of the hay in the moonlight,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还记得吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.68,0:11:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.33,0:11:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我都还记得呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.85,0:12:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的歇洛克 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dear Mr. Sherlock Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.25,0:12:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲离家出走了 您能帮我找到他吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my father has run away. Please will you help me find him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:45.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}蒂莫西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Timothy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.31,0:12:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的猫博斯瓦德失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My cat Boswald is missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.70,0:12:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}钱不是问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Money no object.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.88,0:14:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来告诉你我是怎么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well I'll tell you what I actually think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.70,0:14:13.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得她漂亮极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think she's extraordinarily pretty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.31,0:14:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就是这样想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that's what I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.78,0:14:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且我觉得罗伯特爱得神魂颠倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I think Robert is head over heels in love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.43,0:14:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.58,0:14:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就是这么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's what I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.55,0:14:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}贝拉也是这么想的 对吧 我的天使？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Bella thinks so too don't you my angel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.49,0:14:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}贝拉说多兰小姐也是个泼辣的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bella says Miss.Doran is very [unintelligible].{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}泼辣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very [unintelligible].{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.65,0:14:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的亨丽埃塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dear Henrietta{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可别把艾米利亚的话太过当真了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you mustn't take what Amelia says too seriously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.84,0:14:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一个字儿也没听见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't hear a word of all that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.71,0:14:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗伯特就应该有你这样的太太 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Robert so deserves you my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.04,0:14:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在爱情上遭受过不幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's been unlucky in love{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.44,0:14:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 而他的生意… - 嘘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- and he's business... - Hush,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.52,0:14:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽 记得吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mary, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.80,0:14:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么我就不能把我的话说完？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why can't I finish what I was going to say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.63,0:14:59.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们什么时候开饭？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When do we dine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.60,0:15:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}优雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Exquisite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.78,0:15:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}优雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Exquisite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.81,0:15:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get off me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.69,0:15:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你给我过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come here you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.75,0:15:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get off me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.27,0:15:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 放开我 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Get off me. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.04,0:16:12.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些可怕的事情都是你想像出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've merely imagined all these dreadful things{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.45,0:16:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奥斯瓦尔德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oswald.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.86,0:16:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都是你的想像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was your imagination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.56,0:16:19.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这种痛苦对你来说太沉重了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This agony's been too much for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你好 福尔摩斯先生 - 我可以进去吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hello Mr. Holmes. - May I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.45,0:16:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然了 不过里头在彩排…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes but there rehearsing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.42,0:16:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在家里 跟你的母亲在一起 我亲爱的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At home with your own mother. My blessed boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.20,0:16:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要什么就有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything is yours for the asking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.85,0:16:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像你小时候一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}just like when you were a little child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.49,0:16:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的发作该结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fit is over now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:40.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}母亲 请给我阳光吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mother, give me the suns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奥斯瓦尔德 你到底怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oswald what is the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.95,0:16:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:49.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不认识我了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you not know me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.15,0:16:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.87,0:16:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.73,0:16:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人在看着我们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are being watched?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.39,0:17:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当着陌生人的面我是不彩排的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not rehearse in front of strangers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.43,0:17:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.79,0:17:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go on your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.69,0:17:38.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.58,0:17:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你到底在找什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you looking for then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.16,0:17:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}少管闲事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mind your own business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.35,0:17:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是罗伯特勋爵送来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not Lord Robert's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.68,0:17:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天可是我们的七周年纪念啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's our 7th anniversary isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.20,0:17:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}七年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}7 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.06,0:18:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这该死的纪念日是你的 不是他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your damned anniversary not his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.41,0:18:05.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道 他也知道 连猫都知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know it, he knows it and the cat knows it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.21,0:18:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你到底是怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's the matter with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.04,0:18:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.43,0:18:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去 再给我拿瓶酒来 去啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go and get me another bottle go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.52,0:18:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我又不是他花钱雇来的婊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not his whore to be paid off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.03,0:18:26.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他信任我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He trusted me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.53,0:18:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不是你的婊子 我的勋爵大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not your whore my Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.91,0:18:44.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.86,0:18:50.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来吧 来找你的婊子吧 我的勋爵大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come and use your whore my Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.41,0:18:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你永远不会找到一个像我这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll never have anyone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能为你做任何事情的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who'll do what you want like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.64,0:19:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.43,0:19:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人 我要请你原谅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll pardon me mam{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.46,0:19:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不跟你一起喝 那种法国庄园葡萄酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if I don't join you in drinking that French chateau wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.65,0:19:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对我的口味而言 它太细腻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I guess it's too refined for my taste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.78,0:19:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有些人会说是太高级了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some would say too civilized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.90,0:19:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为您的健康干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll drink you're health{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.97,0:19:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过我要喝的是 塞缪尔马克林的黑麦威士忌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but it'll be in Samuel Markoolin's rye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带有烟味的威士忌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Smoky kind of whiskey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.27,0:19:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我到哪儿都会带着它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I travel it with me all over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.34,0:19:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是太明智了 多兰先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How very wise Mr. Doran.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.74,0:19:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很明智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very wise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.23,0:19:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是一个人有了固定的口味 为什么还要…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If one has an established taste why then...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.34,0:19:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确实如此… 确实如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}just say...just say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.86,0:19:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这种酒真是太好了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The wine sir is magnificent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.81,0:20:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝保佑你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bless you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.46,0:20:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你都知道了吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know don't you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.99,0:20:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我给了海蒂相当可观的一笔钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've settled a considerable amount on Hettie{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.13,0:20:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为她的嫁妆？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for when she's married?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.55,0:20:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她很清楚您的慷慨 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's very conscious of your generosity sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.58,0:20:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她不止一次地提起过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's mentioned it more than once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.01,0:20:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.14,0:20:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在跟我说说你的这座房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now tell me about this house of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.61,0:20:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是座大房子 可他们告诉我它很阴郁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Great house, sad looking they tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.27,0:20:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说得不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll accept that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过我不打算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I'm not prepared to lay out more{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.54,0:20:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在那里多住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for the time I spend there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.10,0:20:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}海蒂告诉我房子很美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hettie has told me how beautiful it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.26,0:20:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想她愿意把它当成自己的一个家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think she'd like it to be one of her homes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我非常愿意尽我所能让海蒂开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would want to please Hettie in any way I can{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.94,0:21:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可我觉得住在格洛文是不可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I'm not sure that living in Glovin is possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.51,0:21:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.75,0:21:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您一直对我很坦诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've always been very frank with me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.93,0:21:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我得向您承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so I'll admit something to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.25,0:21:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我更年轻的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When I was much younger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.05,0:21:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那时少不更事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and barely had a grasp of affairs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.94,0:21:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得到了一些糟蹋的建议 我是说金钱上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was very badly advised, financially I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.83,0:21:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In what way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.82,0:21:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人说服我卖掉 格洛文的外围部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was persuaded to sell off outlying parts of Glovin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.38,0:21:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}结果这处产业就无法 给我带来足够的收入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until there wasn't enough income from the estate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.92,0:21:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去维持房子的开销\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to sustain the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}接着为了修缮房子我又进行了抵押\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then mortgages were taken out to repair things{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.44,0:21:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样我的收入就更少了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which left even less income.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.46,0:21:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有人警告过你有这样的后果吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And nobody warned you of the consequences?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.23,0:21:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我当时很信任我的顾问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I trusted my advisors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.74,0:21:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们也是我父亲的顾问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They were my father's advisors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.17,0:22:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当你在像格洛文那样的地方长大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When you grow up in a place a Glovin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.38,0:22:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会觉得那种生活会是永久不变的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it seems eternal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.14,0:22:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sure I see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.89,0:22:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要去休息了 米勒小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll be off then Miss Miller{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.51,0:22:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望你也能休息一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I hope you'll do the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.33,0:22:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为你在忙也没意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cause there's no point in you doing otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.09,0:22:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 让我摆脱你这个麻烦的女人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well rid me of this troublesome woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.82,0:22:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你是我的救世主吗？- 我说了 出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Are you my savior? - I do say get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.99,0:22:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}钻石王老五大婚 要问… 问为什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eminent Bachelor to Marry-Do We Ask Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.04,0:22:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给你 这个可以让你解决问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here this should kick things off{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.42,0:22:45.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在格洛文重新开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for you to make a start at Glovin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.27,0:22:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您真是太慷慨了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How very generous sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.72,0:22:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你照顾我的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You look after my girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.18,0:22:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就照料你的房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll look after your house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.43,0:23:03.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去帕克俱乐部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Park Club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.72,0:23:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去帕克俱乐部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Park Club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.40,0:23:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}文森特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vincent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.92,0:23:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.77,0:23:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.99,0:23:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.22,0:24:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还记得我们的协议吗 我的勋爵大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remember our agreement my Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.35,0:24:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}付四分之一的款项\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This quarter's payment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.14,0:24:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则我会取消抵押的赎回权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or I will foreclose the mortgages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.64,0:25:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天再过会儿就要结婚了 卡拉汉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have to be married later this morning Callahan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.48,0:25:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}新娘子的父亲是太平洋沿岸最有钱的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The bride's father is the richest man on the Pacific slope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.15,0:25:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她要什么他就会给她什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anything she wants he'll give her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.77,0:25:13.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要我能让她开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as long as I keep her happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.18,0:25:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 是啊 好好让她一直开心吧 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh yes keep her very happy man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.71,0:25:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的搭档和我无意要占有格洛文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My partner and I have no wish to own Glovin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.09,0:25:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请不要逼着我们夺走它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please don't force us to take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.13,0:25:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}剩下的钱会确保那不会发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rest assured that you will never come to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.51,0:25:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请原谅 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll excuse me gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.62,0:26:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 哈德森太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.20,0:26:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你那表情是在责备我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that look of reproach?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.43,0:26:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.29,0:26:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我通常在这个时候起床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No I'm often up at this hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.32,0:26:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些天我不太睡得着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't really sleep these days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.41,0:28:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比例\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Scale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.18,0:28:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这椅子的比例\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The scale of the chair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.27,0:28:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上面痕迹的意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the sense of the stain of the chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.90,0:29:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.39,0:29:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝你们万事如意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May all the best to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.63,0:29:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝你们好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.58,0:29:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 别碰那该死的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Awe, leave the goddamn thing alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.19,0:30:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢天谢地 您来了 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you for coming Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.63,0:30:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么你不早点叫我来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why didn't you call me earlier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.21,0:30:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 我不想…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well I didn't what to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.79,0:30:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 天哪 天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}oh dear, oh dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.89,0:30:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他当然不肯承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He won't admit it of course,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.38,0:30:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是他病了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but he's not well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.06,0:30:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很担心他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm very worried about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.75,0:30:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你该早些告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You should have called me earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.93,0:30:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是他不会让我叫你来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But he wouldn't have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.68,0:30:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道他有多专横吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you know how masterful he is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.66,0:30:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可不敢不听他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't dare disobey him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.76,0:30:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.53,0:30:59.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.63,0:31:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.25,0:31:18.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你对梦境有什么认识？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you know about dreams?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.58,0:31:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你问这个干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why do you ask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.26,0:31:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.84,0:31:25.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我正穿过阴曹地府 而你还问我为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm walking through infernal territory and you ask why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.53,0:31:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不过就是问问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I only meant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.89,0:31:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也不知道我问来干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know what I meant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.53,0:31:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 在维也纳有一个组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well there's a group in Vienna{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.41,0:31:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由一名叫弗洛伊德的年轻医生带领\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Iead by a young doctor called Freud,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.68,0:31:42.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个心理学家 哲学家 精神分析学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a psychologist,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.96,0:31:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请别看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please don't look at them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.34,0:31:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它们都是些涂鸦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are merely scribbles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.24,0:31:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}参考之用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for reference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.22,0:31:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是不是会释梦？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does he seek to explain dreams?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.46,0:31:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想是的 对梦境进行诠释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To interpret them I believe so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.03,0:31:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}梦与做梦者的生活是有联系的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There relationship to the life a dreamer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.87,0:31:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想他们旨在进行科学的解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They aim to be scientific I gather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.21,0:32:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}梦的科学？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The science of dreams,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.22,0:32:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}well, well, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.88,0:32:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的梦很可怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My dream is horrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.60,0:32:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在瀑布上跟莫里亚蒂搏斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm fighting with Moriarty at the Falls{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.53,0:32:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}突如其来的茫然湮没了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and suddenly I'm overwhelmed with a sense of loss,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.08,0:32:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.94,0:32:31.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.01,0:32:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}空荡荡的房间 我失去了比例感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Empty rooms, I've no sense of scale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.22,0:32:41.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一张巨大的椅子 然后又变小了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A huge chair, which diminishes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.87,0:32:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上面的皮革都被撕成了碎片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's upholstery torn to shreds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.94,0:32:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我开始逃离一片沼泽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm starting to escape from a marsh,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.24,0:32:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一片烂泥 一个泥潭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a mire, a quagmire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.11,0:32:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}格林盆沼地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Grimpen Mire{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.92,0:32:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之后出现了… 一只畸形的生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and it appears than an androgynous creature,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.79,0:33:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}像巫婆 像妖婆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}witch like, hag like,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.30,0:33:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}长着爪子 伸向我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with claws, talons, which reach out to me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.86,0:33:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}穿透我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}through me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.31,0:33:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于是我就困在了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I'm trapped...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.74,0:33:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一张蜘蛛网当中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in a mesh of cobwebs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.46,0:33:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后我就醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I awake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.90,0:33:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 你近来吃东西了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hum, are you eating?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.62,0:33:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你睡得不好 就做会些噩梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You sleep badly, you have bad dreams,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.60,0:33:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就更睡不好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you sleep even worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.80,0:33:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有做很多噩梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't have bad dreams;{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.88,0:33:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一次又一次地做同一个梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have one dream more than once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.76,0:33:47.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我们来做个检查吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well let's see how you really are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.48,0:33:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 请不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please don't start that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.13,0:33:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还要告诉你一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I'll tell you something else{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.97,0:33:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于莫里亚蒂的死 我感到很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I regret Moriarty's death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.79,0:34:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说说看 你觉得莫里亚蒂是个什么样的人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me how would you describe Moriarty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.27,0:34:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}邪恶的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.74,0:34:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大魔头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A giant of evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.81,0:34:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确实是大魔头 你说得没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Giant, yes quite so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.38,0:34:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Without him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.78,0:34:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就得跟伤心的小孩 养猫的主人打交道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have to deal with distressed children, cat owners,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.55,0:34:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}微不足道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}pygmies,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.62,0:34:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都是些微不足道的琐事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}pygmies of triviality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.64,0:34:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.53,0:34:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫里亚蒂将科学与邪恶结合了起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Moriarty combined science with evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.43,0:34:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}精确而且有组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Organization with precision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.48,0:34:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}充满了想象力与洞察力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vision with perception.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.54,0:34:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}据我所知 他只错误判断过一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know of only one person that he misjudged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.06,0:34:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.66,0:34:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}收起你的药吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Put away your medicines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.54,0:34:54.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的研讨会怎么样了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How was your seminar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.38,0:34:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}讨论很踊跃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lively.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.46,0:35:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那孩子有些不对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's something wrong with the child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.37,0:35:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她惴惴不安地像只猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is as nervous as a cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.37,0:35:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}帽？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.39,0:35:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.21,0:35:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}艾米利亚戴着帽子看上去是怪怪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Amelia does look curious in a hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.45,0:35:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以前都没这么想过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never thought of it before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.07,0:35:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你当新娘子的那会儿也是很紧张的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even you were nervous as a bride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.82,0:35:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 不是那么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh it's not that,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.32,0:35:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是有些不对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there's something wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.90,0:36:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就要宣布开饭了 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was about to announce my lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.45,0:36:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等我两三分钟 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh give me 2 or 3 minutes would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.91,0:36:04.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well my lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.93,0:36:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让那女孩子来见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get that girl for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.02,0:36:21.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叫她来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.93,0:36:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叫她来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.26,0:36:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的羞怯都上哪儿去了 米勒小姐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is your timidity Miss Miller?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.82,0:36:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在你那冰冷的心里 罗伯特勋爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the cold gutter of your heart Lord Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.48,0:36:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被你践踏在沟渠之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Trampled in the gutter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.07,0:36:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.34,0:37:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我祝你跟那孩子能幸福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish the child joy of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.03,0:37:12.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瞧 贝拉 那是著名的弗洛拉米勒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look Bella there's the famous Flora Miller,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.49,0:37:14.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她曾是罗伯特的一个朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she used to be a friend of Robert's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.88,0:37:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是我觉得她不再喜欢他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I don't think she likes him anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.21,0:37:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can explain everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.53,0:37:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是… 呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was a{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.67,0:37:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是很久以前的事情了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it was a long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.69,0:37:46.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.43,0:38:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她不在楼上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's not upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.44,0:38:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}退下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.52,0:38:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}房子里头都找过了 上上下下都找遍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The house has been searched now top to bottom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.53,0:38:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}连海蒂的影儿都不见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not a sign of Hettie anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.37,0:38:55.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.83,0:38:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爱丽丝？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.52,0:39:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多兰太太的一个斗篷不见了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One of Mrs. Doran's cloaks is missing sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.67,0:39:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没别的了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.72,0:39:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没了 先生 连钱包都还在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No sir not even a purse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.88,0:39:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 爱丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.44,0:39:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我告退了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.24,0:39:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们应当报警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must call the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.61,0:39:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的那个女人呢 那个演戏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What about this woman of yours, this actress,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.23,0:39:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟这事儿会不会有什么关系？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}could she have anything to do with it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.30,0:39:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.45,0:39:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.19,0:39:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我去找警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll get the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.73,0:39:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不反对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you have any objection?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.12,0:39:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.54,0:39:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.74,0:39:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 我亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh my darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.92,0:40:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我告诉过你 你该做的事情就是正常吃东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've told you what you should be doing is eating properly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.43,0:40:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.92,0:40:31.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This has come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.30,0:40:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上面写着"十万火急"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is marked "Most Urgent."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.27,0:40:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太 我还不能看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Hudson I can still see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.63,0:40:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你没事吧 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you all right Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.13,0:40:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道我多希望我把门锁上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know I wish I'd never unlocked the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.31,0:40:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.01,0:40:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上面有私人的亲笔签名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well it's got a personal autograph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.11,0:40:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还算是好的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's an improvement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.30,0:40:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天早上的邮件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This morning's mail{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.56,0:40:50.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是鱼贩和海关监察员来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was from a fishmonger and a tidewaiter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.79,0:40:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 还是高级信笺呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well that's a fashionable epistle indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.17,0:40:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的歇洛克.福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My dear Sherlock Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.48,0:40:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱克沃特勋爵告诉过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lord Blackwater tells me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.68,0:40:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以绝对信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I may place implicit reliance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.92,0:41:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的辨别力与判断力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}upon your judgment and discretion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.47,0:41:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}苏格兰场已经介入此事的调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Scotland Yard is already acting in this matter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.53,0:41:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且对您没有提出任何反对的意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and there is no objection to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.22,0:41:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事情是有关圣西蒙勋爵的婚礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's about that Lord St. Simon wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.14,0:41:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 没意思 没意思 没意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes dull, dull, dull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.55,0:41:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天蓝色 黑色条纹上面有三个蒺藜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Azure, 3 caltrops in chief over a fess sable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.76,0:41:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是他 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's him alright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.14,0:41:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是圣西蒙勋爵 他来早了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's Lord St. Simon, he's early.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.09,0:41:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 华生 我正要睡觉呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson I'm trying to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.22,0:41:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道我办案的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know my methods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.60,0:41:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让门开着就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leave the door open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.33,0:42:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯在哪儿啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is Holmes huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.00,0:42:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生身体不适 勋爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes is indisposed my Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.78,0:42:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他委托我进行初步的调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has entrusted the preliminaries to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.20,0:42:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我熟悉他的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know his methods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.94,0:42:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.22,0:42:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.47,0:42:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了这事儿给我造成的悲痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apart from the distress this has caused me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.37,0:42:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还明白其中的微妙吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you understand the delicacy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.34,0:42:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}完全了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.66,0:42:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}完全了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.02,0:42:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱克沃特勋爵说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lord Blackwater said that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.22,0:42:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生以前处理过类似的案件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes has handled cases of this sort before{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.33,0:42:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管我觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}though hardly I imagine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.70,0:42:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们的社会地位与我不可同日而语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from the same class of society.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.64,0:42:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上 他这次算是纡尊降贵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He would in fact be descending.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.99,0:42:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.15,0:42:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生处理的上一宗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On Mr. Holmes' last client{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.09,0:42:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}类似案件的委托人是一位国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the sort was a King.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.15,0:42:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好极了 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.78,0:42:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呵 我还不知道呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Huh, I had no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.98,0:42:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是哪一位国王呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which King?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.34,0:43:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 勋爵 您应该明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well you can understand my Lord{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.15,0:43:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于其它委托人的事情 他都是完全保密的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that he extends to the affairs of other clients{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.05,0:43:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像他也会对您的事情三缄其口一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the same secrecy, which he's promised you in yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.10,0:43:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.00,0:43:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们要怎么找到她呢 先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How are we to find her sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.10,0:43:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她怎么会失踪呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How can she of disappeared?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.99,0:43:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她在哪儿呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.54,0:43:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须把她找回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must have her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.39,0:43:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个藏在暗中的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A woman obscured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.26,0:43:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在仪式结束后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was after the ceremony outside the church{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.18,0:43:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在教堂外头 我开始觉察她有些不对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that first noticed that something was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.23,0:43:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在你们出来的时候？而不是之前？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you came out and not before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.00,0:43:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.17,0:43:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那她进来的时候呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And as she came in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.84,0:44:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她显得有些不安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She appeared a little apprehensive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.98,0:44:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过看上去还是楚楚动人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but she looked quite lovely{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.58,0:44:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且很开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and very happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.76,0:44:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我没记错的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I remember rightly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.64,0:44:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}报纸上暗示说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the newspapers implied{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.39,0:44:25.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}米勒小姐喝得醉醺醺的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that Miss Miller was drunk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.58,0:44:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出现在你家门口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when she made the scene at your front door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.85,0:44:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}据我判断 是的 很有可能她醉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As far as I could judge yes it was likely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.03,0:44:33.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}勋爵 我可以问问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord would it be in order to ask{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.10,0:44:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你和米勒小姐是什么关系吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the nature of your relationship with Miss Miller?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.85,0:44:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.05,0:44:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}简单地说 她曾是我的情妇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If somewhat naive she was my mistress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.92,0:44:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们几个月前分手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We parted some months ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.31,0:44:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得我当时还是很慷慨的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was I believe generous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.33,0:44:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是不是你遇到多兰小姐时候的事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And that is when you met Miss Doran?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.95,0:44:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上 在那之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Before in fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.34,0:44:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}米勒小姐的酒瘾 之前就曾引起过好几次争吵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Miss Miller's drinking had already led to some scenes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.35,0:44:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她渐渐变得不可信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was becoming very unreliable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.88,0:44:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是否觉得…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you think...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.25,0:45:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是否觉得米勒小姐是那种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you think Miss Miller's the sort of person{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.10,0:45:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比起让你难堪 更会向你复仇的人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to seek revenge on you beyond embarrassing you a bit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.92,0:45:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}酒精对人的影响是难以预料的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Drink affects people unpredictably.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.74,0:45:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}苏格兰场的警察也觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the chap at Scotland Yard also believes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.87,0:45:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}米勒小姐与海蒂的失踪有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Miss Miller to be implicated in Hettie's disappearance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.66,0:45:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你最好还是应应门吧 先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hadn't you better answer the door sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.24,0:45:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.19,0:45:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道 我知道 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know I know Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.54,0:45:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过事情很奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the circumstances are odd though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.41,0:45:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得你该看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I felt you should see this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.69,0:45:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两位女士莫德和海伦娜有何关系？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of ladies Maud and Helena?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.21,0:45:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那妇人是位女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The woman was lady{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.79,0:45:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无疑问的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no doubt about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.33,0:45:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她身上有种东西 我觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was something about her,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.01,0:45:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}引人注目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}compelling I call it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.90,0:45:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常引人注目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}most compelling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.42,0:45:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 哈德森太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you Mrs. Hudson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.52,0:45:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是她的衣服和面纱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never mind her clothes and her veil{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.89,0:45:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是她的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it was her voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.10,0:45:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她可是位女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was a lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.56,0:45:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是说她戴着面纱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you say she wore a veil?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.55,0:45:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.71,0:46:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太 你说得我… 脊背发冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Hudson I have a faint, cold fear runs through my veins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.85,0:46:12.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.63,0:46:14.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你把火生起来好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would you put a match to the fire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.57,0:46:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.36,0:46:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 哈德森太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.50,0:46:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗伯特勋爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now Lord Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.99,0:47:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫德还有海伦娜这两个名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I were to mention the names Maud and Helena to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.42,0:47:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对你来说有什么意义吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would they mean anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.14,0:47:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Certainly they would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.01,0:47:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它们是罗伯特勋爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are names of the 2 women{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.41,0:47:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两位前妻的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to whom Lord Robert was previously married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.32,0:47:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}前妻？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Married?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.96,0:47:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你以前结过婚吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were married?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.35,0:47:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请原谅我朋友的惊讶 勋爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgive my friend's surprise my Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.46,0:47:22.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你干嘛不告诉我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why didn't you tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.43,0:47:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说你想睡的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You said you wanted to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.83,0:47:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我现在清醒得很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well I'm wide-awake now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.03,0:47:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是你很出名啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But your known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.33,0:47:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都说你是这个国家最让人中意的单身汉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even celebrated as one of the most eligible bachelors in the country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.39,0:47:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可没想要出名 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never chose to be celebrated Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.74,0:47:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一直很满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have always been very contented{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.10,0:47:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的婚姻能躲开公众的视线 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that my marriages be kept from the public gaze Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.63,0:47:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.38,0:47:58.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那两次婚姻可不是什么轻松的经历\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They were not comfortable experiences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.94,0:48:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呵 轻松？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hum, comfortable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.46,0:48:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上 很痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Painful indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.58,0:48:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}痛苦？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Painful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.65,0:48:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is what I said Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.40,0:48:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它们和眼下这件事没有什么关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They have no bearing on the matter in hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.81,0:48:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你能不能告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would you oblige me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.30,0:48:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你那两次婚姻是如何结束的呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then by telling me how your marriages ended?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.93,0:48:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第一次 是我妻子死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The first, ended in my wife's death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.00,0:48:27.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第二次 被宣告婚姻无效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The second by annulment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.34,0:48:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.17,0:48:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.20,0:49:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无效的原因呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the grounds of the annulment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.86,0:49:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是被判无效了 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was annulled Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.69,0:49:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 你去把哈德森太太找来好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson will you fetch Mrs. Hudson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.01,0:49:45.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Hudson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.22,0:49:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.16,0:49:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想让你描述一下送来便条的这位女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want you to describe to me the lady who delivered the note.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.03,0:49:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.92,0:49:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我试试吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I'll try sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.29,0:49:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不能只是试试 哈德森太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No you must do more than try Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.62,0:49:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你必须说清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must succeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.85,0:50:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃… 她… 瞧… 瞧 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well...she...Iook...Iook sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.31,0:50:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}街道对面 就是她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on the other side of the street that's her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.11,0:50:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来啊 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.25,0:50:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Drive on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.19,0:50:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.67,0:50:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.18,0:51:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.12,0:51:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.05,0:51:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真拿你没办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I despair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.82,0:51:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.85,0:51:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}电车票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A tram tickets{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.56,0:51:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有一本帐本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and an accounts book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.32,0:51:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都是些数字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Its just figures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.96,0:51:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有地址\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No address.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.87,0:51:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}海蒂女士会步上莫德和海伦娜的后尘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Hettie gone what of Maude and Helena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.99,0:51:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别挡道 哈德森太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Out of the way Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.61,0:51:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.39,0:51:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她是想来暗示什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What did she mean by that

.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.42,0:51:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与失去亲人有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Something about losing a relative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.20,0:51:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}失去双亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To lose one's parents{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.26,0:51:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许就算不幸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}maybe considered unfortunate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.17,0:51:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.78,0:51:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那位戴面纱的女士 想暗示的就是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that's what the veiled lady was trying to advise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.57,0:51:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}失去一位妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To lose one wife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.42,0:51:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以说是一起不幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}maybe considered unfortunate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.79,0:51:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是失去三位妻子呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but to lose 3?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.65,0:51:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看上去是因为他不负责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Begins to look like carelessness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.65,0:51:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经超过了不负责任 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rank carelessness Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.41,0:52:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是反常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Freaky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.66,0:52:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那位女士究竟是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who is this woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.02,0:52:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得读读你那有关罗伯特勋爵的笔记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must read your notes on Lord Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.02,0:52:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 讲点道理吧 华生 我会吃东西的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh be reasonable Watson I will eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.46,0:52:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不能离开这个房间 你需要休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're not Leaving this room you need rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.95,0:52:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}休息？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.52,0:52:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧 那你明天早上得去拜会多兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well then you'll have to interview Doran tomorrow morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.63,0:52:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.72,0:52:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}梦的科学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The science of dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.53,0:53:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多么神秘的语言啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What an undiscovered language.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.70,0:53:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟我们的先人们想的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like our ancestors thought of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.19,0:53:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}梦具有预言性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Prophetic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.83,0:53:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}行 你看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes you may look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.14,0:53:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}具有洞察力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Precognisense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.72,0:53:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个小小的本子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This little book,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.49,0:53:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们得等到它干了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we must wait until it dries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.47,0:53:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至于那位戴面纱的女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The woman with the veil{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.48,0:53:35.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必须找到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she must be found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.21,0:54:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很抱歉打扰你 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry to disturb you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.99,0:54:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是蒙哥马利警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Inspector Montgomery,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.08,0:54:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想看看您是否能辨认一下这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wonder if you could identify this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.56,0:54:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想这位年轻的女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I understand the young lady{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.74,0:54:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在离开屋子的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was wearing her wedding dress{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.87,0:54:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是身着婚纱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when she left the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.62,0:54:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 那是海蒂的婚纱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes that's Hettie's wedding dress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.14,0:54:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很感谢您能拨冗前来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm grateful to you for your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.02,0:55:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.85,0:55:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大家告诉我拜访福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been told a visit to Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.80,0:55:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是件很愉快的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is always entertaining if nothing else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.79,0:55:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莱文顿温泉疗养地？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Levington Spa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.24,0:55:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}雷斯垂德在莱文顿温泉疗养地干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's Lastrad doing at Levington Spa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.55,0:55:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下水啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Taking the waters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.59,0:55:17.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很遗憾见到你卧病在家 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh sorry to see you laid up Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.14,0:55:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯定给你的调查带来很大的不便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Must cramp your style no end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.96,0:55:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.08,0:55:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们也没闲着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've not been idle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.99,0:55:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经拘捕弗洛拉 米勒小姐进行询问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've arrested Miss Flora Miller for questioning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.20,0:55:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可米勒小姐将在"伦敦西区"一剧中担任主角啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But Miss Miller is playing a leading role in the West End.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.81,0:55:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么拘捕她？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.29,0:55:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗洛拉 米勒出现在婚礼上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Flora Miller was seen at the wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.45,0:55:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她来找受害人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then she came looking for the victim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.94,0:55:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还袭击了罗伯特勋爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She attacked Lord Robert{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.54,0:55:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}离开房子后不久 有人看见 多兰小姐跟她在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and then she was seen with Miss Doran shortly after she left her house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.99,0:55:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是她什么也不肯说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but she'll tell us nothing about it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.97,0:55:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一言不发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.16,0:55:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有这个东西 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And there's this Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.18,0:55:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此地你知 请速来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know where to come as soon as you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.50,0:55:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我将等候全天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will wait all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.28,0:55:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}署名是“F.M.”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And its signed "F.M."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.08,0:55:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.25,0:55:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相当具有决定性的 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fairly conclusive wouldn't you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.79,0:56:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在哪儿找到的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where'd you find this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.20,0:56:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在婚纱的口袋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the pocket of the wedding dress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.82,0:56:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看反了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're looking at the wrong side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.35,0:56:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know what's on the other side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.48,0:56:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对不起 你叫什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excuse me what is your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.83,0:56:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}蒙哥马利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Montgomery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.81,0:56:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是位巡官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.17,0:56:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 一位巡官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh an inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.44,0:56:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这纸片是从一张旅馆账单上撕下来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is torn from a hotel bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.47,0:56:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}房间 8先令 早餐 2先令6便士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rooms 8 shillings breakfast 2 and 6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.95,0:56:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}鸡尾酒 1先令 午餐2先令6便士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cocktails a shilling luncheon 2 and 6{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.36,0:56:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}雪利酒一杯 8便士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a glass of sherry, 8 pence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.52,0:56:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看过了 没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have looked at that, there's nothing in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.19,0:56:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}据我所知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know very few hotels{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.50,0:56:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没几家旅馆敢对一杯雪利酒收8便士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that would dare to charge 8 pence for a glass of sherry,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.20,0:56:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过 巡官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}however inspector{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.13,0:56:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想见见米勒小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would like to interview please, Miss Miller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.93,0:56:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're welcome to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.40,0:56:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good day Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.04,0:56:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见 华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doctor Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.23,0:56:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.45,0:56:48.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝您走运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh and good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.49,0:56:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝你走运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good luck to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.98,0:56:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一想到雷斯垂德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The thought of a Lastrad,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.61,0:56:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在莱文顿温泉疗养地逍遥自在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ioose at Levington Spa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.14,0:56:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真希望他太太跟他一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do hope his wife went with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.27,0:57:03.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我需要你那个新潮的烧瓶 还有一小瓶杜松子酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need your hip flask and a small bottle of gin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.32,0:57:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杜松子酒？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.15,0:57:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那张旅馆账单…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That hotel bill,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.90,0:57:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the message,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.98,0:57:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应该是通过某种方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it must have been passed some how{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.82,0:57:16.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}传递给了在教堂里的多兰小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to Miss Doran in the church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.10,0:57:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}问题一 怎么传递的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Question one, how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.72,0:57:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}问题二 谁传递的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Question two, by who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.36,0:57:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}显然就是那个她跑去会面的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Clearly by the person she went to meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.74,0:57:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 名字缩写是“F.M.” - 弗洛拉 米勒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- With the initials "F.M." - Flora Miller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.78,0:57:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不一定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wonder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.10,0:57:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.35,0:57:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对米勒小姐的证据是越来越不利了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the evidence is looking increasingly good against Miss Miller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.78,0:57:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在我还得到了这位先生的证词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I now have this gentlemen's evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.82,0:57:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请允许我介绍乔治泰迪先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I introduce Mr. George Tidy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.93,0:57:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你好 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do you do sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.08,0:57:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是帕克俱乐部的老门房了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's the senior porter at the Park Club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.99,0:57:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他打算做证说在圣西蒙勋爵的婚礼前夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's prepared to testify that Miss Miller{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.94,0:57:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}米勒小姐用一把手枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}took a shot with a pistol{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.15,0:57:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}朝勋爵开了一枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at Lord St. Simon on the night before his wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.27,0:57:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果属实的话 那就非常有意思了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If true, its most intriguing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.35,0:58:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 千真万确的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh it's true all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.69,0:58:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}千真万确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh it's true all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.19,0:58:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}泰迪先生有证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Tidy has the proof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.30,0:58:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The bullet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.42,0:58:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.03,0:58:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是一把小手枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A pocket gun wouldn't you say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.01,0:58:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过不是米勒小姐的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but not Miss Miller's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.18,0:58:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是米勒小姐的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not Miss Miller's?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.94,0:58:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No it's certainly not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.69,0:58:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能射出会拐弯的子弹的手枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gun is yet to be invented{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.26,0:58:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还没发明出来呢 巡官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that can shoot around corners Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.72,0:58:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 有人在这儿开了一枪 - 这是肯定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Well someone took a shot here. - Of course they did{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.21,0:58:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}泰迪先生 你觉得开枪的是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}now Mr. Tidy who do you think attempted this murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.73,0:58:48.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've no idea sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.37,0:58:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当时周围还有几个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But there were several other people about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.25,0:58:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我注意到 枪响的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I noticed that the door of his Lordship's carriage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.81,0:59:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}勋爵的马车门重重地关上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}banged at the same time as the gun went off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.06,0:59:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过真正引起我注意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But what really alerted me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.71,0:59:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是弹射出来的石头碎片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was the chips coming out of the stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.75,0:59:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于是很自然地我就转过身去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well naturally after that I had to turn{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.87,0:59:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}结果发现她站在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and there she was,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.62,0:59:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是米勒小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Miss Miller I mean,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.77,0:59:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她生气地瞪着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}staring at me furious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.58,0:59:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以你以为是她开了那一枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As though you thought it was she who had fired the shot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.05,0:59:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}倒是很自然的事 不过事情不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very natural, however it was not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.32,0:59:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这事是由一位或几位不知名的人干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Person or persons unknown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.71,0:59:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你它妈是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And who the devil are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.70,0:59:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}米勒小姐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Miss Miller?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.18,0:59:43.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真的知道你不该在这的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am acutely aware that you should not be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.75,0:59:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很高兴听到你这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm glad to hear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.89,0:59:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是歇洛克.福尔摩斯 为您效劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm Sherlock Holmes at your service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.95,0:59:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能为我效劳的 就是去给我弄瓶酒来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only service you could do me is to be carrying a bottle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.95,0:59:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.43,1:00:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好啊 你倒是个蛮有教养的人嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, well what an extraordinary civilized citizen you turn out to be then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.21,1:00:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是来调查圣西蒙夫人失踪一事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am here to investigate the disappearance of Lady St. Simon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.73,1:00:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那孩子只不过是有了常识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The child simply had the common sense{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.40,1:00:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发现了她把自己送上了什么路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to see what she was letting herself in for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.30,1:00:38.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她把自己送上了什么路呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what was she letting herself in for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.70,1:00:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和罗伯特 圣西蒙一起生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A life with Lord Robert St. Simon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.35,1:00:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能说说那样可能的代价吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can you describe what that might entail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.80,1:00:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我把所有的事情都告诉那孩子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I told the child all about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.32,1:01:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我记不太清了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't quite remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.07,1:01:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很漫长的一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's been a long day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.36,1:01:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我累极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was very tired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.36,1:01:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天知道我告诉了她什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God knows what I said to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.24,1:01:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不记得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.43,1:01:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dear Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.11,1:01:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我 艾格尼丝诺思科特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I Agnes Northcote,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.09,1:01:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}神志清醒 身体健康…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}being of sound mind and body...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.34,1:02:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你注意到海蒂 多兰小姐离开了房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You observed Miss Hettie Doran leave the house,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.17,1:02:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你向她做了自我介绍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you introduced yourself to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.85,1:02:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们一起在公园散步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You walked together in the park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.56,1:02:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你告诉她要提防圣西蒙勋爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You warned her against Lord St. Simon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.28,1:02:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.43,1:02:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她有没有试图捍卫西蒙勋爵？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did she try to defend Sir Simon to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.06,1:02:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.61,1:02:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一点也没有吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not at all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.37,1:02:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她就说了句"谢谢你"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All she said was thank you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.25,1:02:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"这事让我下定了决心"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that has decided me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.53,1:02:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 继续说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.51,1:02:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你把她带回了剧院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You took her back to the theatre{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.77,1:02:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又派人去买了些衣服 是吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and sent out for some clothes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.60,1:02:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.63,1:02:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她身上带了钱吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Had she money with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.86,1:02:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 衣服的钱是我付的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, I bought the clothes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.89,1:02:48.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还给了她几个金币\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I gave her a couple of sovereign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.00,1:02:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真是太好心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That was very good of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.73,1:02:51.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.98,1:02:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她说她父亲会偿还这笔钱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She told me her father would reimburse it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.36,1:02:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她还替我写了张便条给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She wrote a note to him for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.82,1:02:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 一张便条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah a note.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.18,1:03:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能谈谈圣西蒙勋爵之前的几次婚姻吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now can you tell me anything about Lord St. Simon's previous marriages?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.03,1:03:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.08,1:03:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.83,1:03:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是没什么 我就为现在而活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing. I live for the present{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.36,1:03:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其它的事情都是浪费时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and nothing else is a waste of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.49,1:03:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你对他第一任妻子的死一无所知吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know nothing about his first wife's death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.54,1:03:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.88,1:03:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第二次婚姻被宣布无效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The second marriage was annulled,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.56,1:03:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道为什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}do you know why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.22,1:03:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.33,1:03:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}通常只有当夫妻双方 有一方不适合结婚时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well an annulment usually takes place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.48,1:03:27.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}婚姻才会被宣布无效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when there's unfitness in one of the partners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.47,1:03:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道是怎么回事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you know what that might be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.61,1:03:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.97,1:03:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不知道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.26,1:03:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一无所知吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.24,1:03:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是不是他什么都不许你谈？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're not permitted to discuss anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.32,1:03:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.87,1:03:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以问问为什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I ask why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.07,1:03:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.76,1:03:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}根本没有哪个男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not any a man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.81,1:03:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能配得上这样的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}should be worthy of such love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.58,1:03:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是不是因为激情？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it passion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.56,1:03:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是恐惧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.29,1:04:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 我明白了 米勒小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh I see Miss Miller{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.42,1:04:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是兼而有之\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.32,1:04:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I apprise you I shall do my best{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.84,1:04:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会尽力确保你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to see that you are released{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.26,1:04:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}摆脱这种毫无道理的羁押\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from this nonsensible confinement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.46,1:04:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}米勒小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Miss Miller?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.76,1:04:48.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.75,1:05:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}差不多好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is nearly ready{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.11,1:05:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道多兰女儿失踪一案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know the disappearance of Doran's daughter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.77,1:05:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应该是很简单的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ought to be a simple matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.36,1:05:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无须什么协助 谜底会自动揭开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It should solve itself without further assistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.04,1:05:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是罗伯特勋爵呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But what about Lord Robert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.15,1:05:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他干了什么会招来三个复仇天使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What has he done to warrant 3 avenging angels,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.36,1:05:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或是女巫？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}witches?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.30,1:05:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女巫？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Witches?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.43,1:05:49.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 躲在黑暗里的一个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well a woman obscured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.83,1:05:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许时间的进程被调整过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps time is shaped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.31,1:05:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们无法梦到未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We cannot dream the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.63,1:06:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 也许未来就在我们身边 我准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh maybe the future is all around us, I'm ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.93,1:06:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.05,1:06:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很遗憾里头的线索如此之少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a pity there's so little in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.70,1:06:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有一些数字和缩写字母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just a few figures and initials.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.80,1:06:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无疑问 你会有更多发现的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No doubt you'll find more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.47,1:06:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.15,1:06:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好像是蝴蝶脆弱的翅膀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's like a delicate membranes of a butterfly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.90,1:06:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 这可怜的女人真是一贫如洗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh the poor woman is destitute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.98,1:06:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赤贫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Destitute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.02,1:06:44.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}书页间充满了愤怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah their's rage on this page.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.80,1:06:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看看她是怎么撕掉这些纸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look how she's torn the paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.66,1:06:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh what have we here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.18,1:06:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一根线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.20,1:06:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是一位女裁缝吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A seamstress?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.23,1:07:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是一个做花边的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lace maker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.21,1:07:04.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或是一个编织工？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Web maker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.67,1:07:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈 她还爱读书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah she reads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.02,1:07:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}勃朗特 简奥斯汀 和索福克勒斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bronte, Jane Austen and Sophocles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.75,1:07:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.69,1:07:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}戴面纱的女士 她回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The woman with the veil, she's back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.05,1:07:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}歇洛克.福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Sherlock Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.31,1:07:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 正是在下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes I am he.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.21,1:07:49.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们以前见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've met before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.81,1:07:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是艾格尼丝诺思科特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am Agnes Northcote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.15,1:07:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诺思科特小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Miss Northcote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.10,1:08:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您有什么要告诉我的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What have you to say to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.79,1:08:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我告诉您这个之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Before I can tell you that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.47,1:08:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须先知道 您和圣西蒙勋爵有什么关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must know your connection with Lord St. Simon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.84,1:08:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么关系也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.42,1:08:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.37,1:08:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们在调查他妻子失踪一案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are investigating his wife's disappearance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.95,1:08:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 你不该找她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh you must not find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.58,1:08:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这样说得有理由才行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Such an edict requires justification.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.76,1:08:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}任何有钱的女人 都逃脱不了他的毒手 相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No woman with a fortune is safe from him believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.14,1:08:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 相信我 - 是嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Believe me. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.43,1:08:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是我的思维\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well I'm afraid I am burdened{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.79,1:08:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是很理性的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with a rational turn of mind,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.11,1:08:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我需要证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need proofs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.43,1:08:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诺思科特小姐 我需要证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Miss Northcote I need proofs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.11,1:08:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have no proof{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.60,1:08:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我坚信如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}only my conviction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.64,1:08:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且还曾经经历过 不只是我的经历\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and experiences not just my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.25,1:08:41.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坚信 那可是难得的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Conviction well that's a luxury{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.62,1:08:43.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我差点都忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I have almost forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.77,1:08:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}显然你有很多要告诉我们的 诺思科特小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You clearly have much to tell us Miss Northcote{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.00,1:08:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请坐 请坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}please, please sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.33,1:08:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要说的是关于我姐姐的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have about my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.20,1:08:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能说说她发生了什么事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shall I tell you what happened to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.05,1:09:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是我来这儿的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is why I came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.45,1:09:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}海伦娜是我见过的人当中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Helena was more alive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.85,1:09:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最有活力的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than anyone I've ever met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.55,1:09:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她有她自己的财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She had her fortune{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.71,1:09:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的命运掌握在她自己手中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she was in charge of her fate,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.92,1:09:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这可是很多女人难得拥有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as few women are,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.27,1:09:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直到她遇见了罗伯特 圣西蒙勋爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until she met Lord Robert St. Simon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.23,1:09:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他毁了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He destroyed her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.35,1:09:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他夺去了她的财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He took her fortune,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.78,1:09:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他娶了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he married her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.05,1:09:25.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又把她毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and he destroyed her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.66,1:09:28.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.06,1:09:39.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他让人把她送到一家精神病院里头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He had her committed to a mad house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.21,1:09:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只需要两个医生的签名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It required only the signature of 2 doctors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.20,1:09:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这事就办成了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the deed was done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.49,1:09:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是什么时候的事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When was this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.40,1:09:46.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在这样的事情不可能发生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It could not happen today,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.46,1:09:48.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we have the Lunacy Act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.12,1:09:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 不可能吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh could it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.54,1:09:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 也许是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well that's as maybe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.09,1:09:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是条例的出台对我姐姐来说太迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but the act came too late for my sister{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.29,1:10:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当条例实施的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and when the Lunacy Act became enforced{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.02,1:10:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他还是让人把她关进了精神病院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he still had her put away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.88,1:10:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们不能随便把人关进精神病院的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}People can't just be put away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.90,1:10:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然可以 如果你的叔叔是位公爵就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They can if you're uncle is a Duke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.78,1:10:14.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是你长得英俊又能花言巧语也行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you're handsome and plausible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.88,1:10:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且是基于你刚才说的条例\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}under the terms of your precious act{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.67,1:10:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要求他们对她被关押的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I demanded that conditions of her confinement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.71,1:10:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作出评估 他们也做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}were inspected and so they were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.86,1:10:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个小小的学术委员会最终到了格洛文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A small but learned committee went to Glovin eventually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.73,1:10:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}海伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Helen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.54,1:10:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们知道他们得找什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Knowing what they wanted to find{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.10,1:10:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然他们就找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and of course they found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.50,1:10:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们被富有同情心的罗伯特勋爵迷惑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Charmed by the compassionate Lord Robert{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.05,1:10:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他把她的妻子关起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who had kept his wife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.91,1:10:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是因为他曾经貌美如花的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a profoundly depressed person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.82,1:10:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}极度情绪低落 而且令人伤心地迷失了自我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Once beautiful now sadly destructed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.72,1:10:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而他的妻子受到了令人赞叹的照顾 环境干净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in conditions that can only be wondered at for their cleanliness,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.27,1:10:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}整洁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they're orderliness,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.65,1:10:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看护质量很高等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}their quality of nursing and so on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.33,1:11:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有一件事情他们没有注意到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only one thing was amiss,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.37,1:11:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是那个人不是我姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it was not my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.00,1:11:06.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}海伦娜并没有疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Helena was not mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.64,1:11:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那人不是她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was not her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.86,1:11:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他雇了别人来冒充她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He'd hired someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.83,1:11:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗洛拉 米勒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Flora Miller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.16,1:11:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Robert!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.64,1:11:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那不是我姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was not my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.69,1:11:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was not her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.47,1:11:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那她现在在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And where is she now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.38,1:11:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我自己去了一趟格洛文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I went to Glovin myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.26,1:11:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得查清真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had to find the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.15,1:11:47.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的收获就是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My reward was this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.09,1:12:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诺思科特小姐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Miss Northcote?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.99,1:12:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你发现真相了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you discover the truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.01,1:12:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.29,1:12:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道该怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did not know how to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.09,1:12:43.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我被愤怒和悲伤蒙蔽了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was blind with anger and grief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.44,1:12:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我甚至想不起我是怎么到那儿去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have no recollection of even how I got there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.81,1:12:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只知道有一天我发现我自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I only know that I found myself one day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.82,1:13:01.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正穿过那个该死的地方 一重重的门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}walking through the gates of that accursed place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.12,1:15:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我被扔在树林之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was left in part of the wood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.19,1:15:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是关动物的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}where the animals are kept{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.59,1:15:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那样事情看上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so it might look as though{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.78,1:15:59.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像是我没有听从劝告去了那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had been attacked by one of them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.75,1:16:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而受到了一头动物的袭击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}after ignoring notices not to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.21,1:16:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我被一些佃农发现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was found by some cottagers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.69,1:16:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}才活了下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And kept alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.41,1:16:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是您能查出我姐姐是死是活 我将万分感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would thank you to find out whether my sister was alive or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.74,1:16:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不查清楚这事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I only live a half-life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.51,1:16:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我虽生犹死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for not knowing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.17,1:16:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有什么能驱除我心里的阴霾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing seems to break the gray cycle I live in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.99,1:16:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管我做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.00,1:16:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么都不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.31,1:17:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夜晚我穿过街道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I walk the streets at night,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.82,1:17:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}寻找着危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Iooking for danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.49,1:17:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有时我觉得我是在 请求这个世界给予我伤害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sometimes I think I'm asking the world to hurt me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.80,1:17:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好让我觉得我还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so I can feel alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.05,1:17:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天哪 我梦见的就是这个啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good God what else may I've dreamt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.90,1:17:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}送洗的衣服？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The laundry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.02,1:17:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诺思科特小姐 您能再告诉我一件事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Miss Northcote will you satisfy me upon one point?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.21,1:17:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我愿尽我所能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.04,1:17:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在流浪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're meanderings,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.27,1:17:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在夜里流浪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}nocturnal meanderings,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.85,1:17:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有没有走过帕克俱乐部？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}do they ever take you past the Park Club?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.61,1:17:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣西蒙勋爵 在婚礼前夜遭到枪击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lord St. Simon was shot at on the night before his wedding{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.88,1:17:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你干的吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that was you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.87,1:17:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无法眼睁睁地看着 另一条生命遭到毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Couldn't bear to see another life destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.80,1:18:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗伯特勋爵的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lord Robert's wife,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.05,1:18:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的第一任妻子是被谋杀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}first wife, was murdered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.95,1:18:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谋杀？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Murdered?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.59,1:18:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她也拥有一笔财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She also had a fortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.01,1:18:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们在法国度完蜜月不久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was robbed and killed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.25,1:18:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她就遭到了抢劫并被杀害了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}shortly after their honeymoon in France.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.81,1:18:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁干的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.39,1:18:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个叫托马斯弗鲁特的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man called Thomas Floutier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.92,1:18:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他被定罪了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was he convicted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.91,1:18:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 可是他逃走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes but he escaped{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.37,1:18:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他现在在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and where is he now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.23,1:18:28.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得他在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where do you think he is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.10,1:18:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Any idea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.27,1:18:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}格洛文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glovin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.00,1:18:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我不知道… 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No I don't know... I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.52,1:18:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have no proof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.33,1:18:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只不过是凭借直觉吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just the strength of your convictions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.08,1:18:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.27,1:18:45.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诺思科特小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Miss Northcote{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.11,1:18:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕你那一枪的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm afraid the sound of your shot{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.29,1:18:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有传到我们高贵的单身汉的耳朵里啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}never reached the ears of our noble bachelor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.40,1:18:57.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第三次结婚的圣西蒙勋爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The thrice married Lord St. Simon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.72,1:19:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能指望你明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot expect you to understand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.98,1:19:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有多羡慕你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}how much I envy you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.89,1:19:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}棋逢对手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A delight it must be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.99,1:19:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是令人愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to face an opponent of some worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.71,1:19:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}失陪一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.47,1:19:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Hudson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.37,1:19:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他真的会帮忙吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is he really going to help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.70,1:19:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.75,1:19:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他已经在帮忙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He already is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.57,1:19:43.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}贝拉当时在教堂里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bella was in the church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.16,1:19:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对吧 我的宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Weren't we my sweetness,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.45,1:19:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我悄悄把贝拉带了进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I smuggled Bella in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.78,1:19:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她像金子般闪耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was as good as gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.90,1:19:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发生了什么事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did anything occur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.66,1:19:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 没有什么异常的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh nothing occurred out of the ordinary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.84,1:19:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向你保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll assure you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.63,1:19:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好好想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please try to remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.25,1:20:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦对了 甜蜜的小海蒂 把花束掉在地上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh yes, sweet little Hettie dropped her bouquet you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.14,1:20:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人把它捡了起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And had it picked up for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.98,1:20:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 掉了花束 - 那人挺迷人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Dropped her bouquet. - He was quite an attractive,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.14,1:20:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是说那个帮她捡起花束的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the one who picked it up I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.40,1:20:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想大概是多兰家的一个亲戚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One of the Doran's I suppose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.85,1:20:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他看上去一身美国味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He looked American at any rate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.82,1:20:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.64,1:20:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杜阿尔特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Duarte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.71,1:20:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不会碰巧还有一个女继承人备用吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't I suppose have another heiress up your sleeve?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.33,1:20:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}见你的鬼 卡拉汉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Damn you Callahan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.78,1:20:46.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你都看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The newspapers you see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.11,1:20:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}报纸上报道了你岳父家门口发生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}reported a scene of disgusting vulgarity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.31,1:20:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恶心粗鄙的一幕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on your father in-law's doorstep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.76,1:20:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我纳闷你要怎么对他解释？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wonder how you'll explain that to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.93,1:20:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多兰觉得我清白无辜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doran doesn't think me uninnocent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.17,1:20:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他接受了我的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He accepted my story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.66,1:21:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}显而易见 米勒小姐喝醉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was clear to everyone that Miss Miller was drunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.20,1:21:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而你则从我的搭档那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And managed to obtain from my partners{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.96,1:21:09.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}获得了一次缓刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a temporary stay of execution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.42,1:21:12.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就这样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.58,1:21:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一天还是两天？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a day or two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.58,1:21:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你必须给我证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must have proof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.42,1:21:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}证明什么 看在老天的份上？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Proof of what for God's sake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.33,1:21:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}证明那只加州的小鹅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Proof that the Californian goose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.40,1:21:27.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还愿意把金蛋下在格洛文 就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}remains willing to lay its golden eggs at Glovin that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.50,1:21:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 这事不会搞砸了吧？- 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Nothing was jeopardized that? - No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.09,1:21:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 没有？- 没有 当然没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Nothing? - No of course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.30,1:21:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那米勒小姐呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What about Miss Miller?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.96,1:21:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是她能唱那么一出戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If she's capable of a scene like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.01,1:21:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她还能唱别的什么吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What else is she capable of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.44,1:21:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望她没有什么别的事情可说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hope she has nothing else to reveal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.25,1:21:44.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.46,1:21:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一点也不 勋爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not an inch my Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.42,1:21:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我刚刚发现一位 叫弗兰西斯 海 莫尔顿的先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just discovered a Mr. Francis Hay Moulton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.50,1:22:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}住在26号房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is in room 26.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.91,1:22:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位美国绅士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An American gentleman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.06,1:22:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的妻子昨天刚刚才到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whose wife only joined him yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.36,1:22:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他名字的缩写是FHM\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His initials are F.H.M.,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.72,1:22:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}F.M.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}F.M.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.61,1:22:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 啊 对不起 - 等等 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Ah excuse me, - One moment please sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.89,1:22:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有什么能为您效劳的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And how can I assist you sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.48,1:22:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}雪利酒一杯多少钱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How much is a glass of sherry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.71,1:22:23.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}8便士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That would be 8.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.42,1:22:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.07,1:23:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我私底下答应了莫尔顿先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I personally promise Mr. Moulton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.82,1:23:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说你们两个都可以自由地回加州去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you will both be free to return to California.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.29,1:23:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就当是 你的妻子从未进过那家教堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will be as if you're wife had never entered that church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.29,1:23:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是怎么找到我们的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did you find us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.43,1:23:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个并不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is unimportant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.58,1:23:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是你想听听我的看法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I may give you my opinion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.99,1:23:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想这里头的秘密太多了一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think there's been a little too much secrecy already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.67,1:23:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以跟莫尔顿太太谈谈吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I speak to Mrs. Moulton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.38,1:23:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要先告诉我你们两个到底是谁才行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not before you tell who the devil you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.19,1:23:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们受雇于圣西蒙勋爵 他要我们寻找他的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're been engaged by Lord St. Simonto find his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.21,1:23:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫尔顿先生 她父亲的反应会很激烈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Moulton, her father will take it very hard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.18,1:23:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想她没有跟他沟通过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think that she did not communicate with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.29,1:23:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是她有的 该死的 她有沟通过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But she did damn it, she did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.58,1:23:52.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错 弗洛拉 米勒的便条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yes the note from Flora Miller{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.08,1:23:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在应该到他手上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he would have received it by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.68,1:23:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.73,1:23:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她父亲从未认可我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her father never approved of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.77,1:23:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 是嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.29,1:24:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道在海湾海岸…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see up in the Gulf Shores...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.50,1:24:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然这就是她父亲的理由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Surely these are explanations for her father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.39,1:24:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是你能听我说完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You made criticism of Henrietta's duties{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.73,1:24:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会发现你是在批评亨丽埃塔 对她父亲的孝心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}towards her father if you'll hear me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.62,1:24:15.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我答应了老多兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I promised old man Doran{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.46,1:24:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会离开 不再打扰亨丽埃塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd go away and not trouble Henrietta{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.81,1:24:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直到我出人头地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until I'd made my way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.23,1:24:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过我们在我离开之前秘密结了婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but we got married in secret before I went.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.36,1:24:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}后来 有人告诉他们 我死在西北了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I was reported dead up in the high northwest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.06,1:24:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨丽埃塔于是 就把我们秘密结婚的事告诉他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so Henrietta told him then about our secret marriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.56,1:24:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他派人去调查 看我是否像他们说的那样死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He sent someone out to check I was dead like they said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.82,1:24:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那人一直没有找到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That man never found me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.61,1:24:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨丽埃塔因我的死而死心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so Henrietta gave me up for dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.02,1:24:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗兰西斯 哈利 莫尔顿先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And so Mr. Francis Harry Moulton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.91,1:24:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大概你是出人头地了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}presumably you have made your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.00,1:24:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我现在经营旅馆 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm in hotels sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.01,1:24:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}旅馆？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hotels?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.23,1:25:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.31,1:25:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.47,1:25:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一杯雪利酒你收费多少？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How much do you charge for a glass of sherry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.51,1:25:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟这家旅馆一样 8便士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The same as this hotel, 8 pence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.43,1:25:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗伯特？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Robert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.70,1:25:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗伯特？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Robert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.41,1:26:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗洛拉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Flora?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.06,1:26:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.59,1:26:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太迟了 罗伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's too late Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.08,1:26:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我把所有的事情都告诉那孩子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I told the child everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.78,1:27:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管怎么说圣西蒙勋爵本来可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anyway Lord St. Simon may as well of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.14,1:27:02.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}省下雇佣你们的钱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}saved his money from employing you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.88,1:27:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说这话什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why do you say that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.69,1:27:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为亨丽埃塔去见他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because Henrietta has gone to see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.14,1:27:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真希望她不要那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish she had not done that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.07,1:27:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗洛拉 米勒谢世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}FLORA MILLER DEAD{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.21,1:29:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你好 海蒂 我亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hello Hettie my darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.67,1:30:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你上哪儿去了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where have you been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.65,1:30:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去哪儿了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where you'd disappear to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.74,1:30:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.31,1:30:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你妻子在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is your wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.45,1:30:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就是我的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.45,1:30:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我都不知道我算什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know what I am anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.69,1:30:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说什么啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.00,1:30:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗伯特 你干嘛不告诉我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Robert why didn't you tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.38,1:30:19.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉你什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell you what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.75,1:30:20.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.10,1:30:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切有关你妻子们的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything about your wives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.50,1:30:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那都是过去的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.98,1:30:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无关紧要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unimportant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.85,1:30:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不想再旧事重提\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't want to relive the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.01,1:30:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过去已经死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the past is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.82,1:30:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而你 你才是未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You, you are the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.26,1:30:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 她在哪儿？- 谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Where is she? - Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.74,1:30:45.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.60,1:30:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have only you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.34,1:30:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的 我的那段婚姻已经无效了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My darling the marriage was annulled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.72,1:30:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你跟弗洛拉 米勒谈过吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you been talking to Flora Miller?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.76,1:30:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道你准谈过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know you have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.34,1:30:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 亲爱的 我求你别听那女人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh my darling I beg you not to listen to that woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.11,1:30:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她是个醉鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is a drunk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.87,1:31:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她毫无廉耻 满口谎言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she has no sense of decency or truth left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.62,1:31:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}海伦娜现在在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is Lady Helena now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.46,1:31:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我怎么知道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How should I know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.67,1:31:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她正受到照料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Being cared for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.34,1:31:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你关心她吗 罗伯特？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you care for her Robert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.05,1:31:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我花钱请人照看她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I pay for her care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.10,1:31:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看见她太让人痛苦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seeing her is to painful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.50,1:31:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那可怜的人自我虐待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The poor creature is afflicted with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.33,1:31:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}受尽折磨 满脑子幻觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}self-persecution and instilled with delusions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.62,1:31:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每次我去…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}every time I have been...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.85,1:31:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当局已经要求我不要再去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the authorities have asked me not to go anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.05,1:31:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当局？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The authorities?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.46,1:31:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她还活着吗 罗伯特？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is she alive Robert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.10,1:31:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说什么啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.20,1:31:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.50,1:31:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信弗洛拉 米勒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe Flora Miller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.66,1:31:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信她对我说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe what she told me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.23,1:31:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想想都让我觉得恶心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and it makes me ill to think it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.45,1:31:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还以为她是个醉鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I thought she was a drunk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.51,1:31:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只不过是又一个醉鬼 但那又怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}just another drunk but it didn't mean anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.32,1:31:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你从一家私人医院带走了海伦娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You took Lady Helena away from a private hospital,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.22,1:32:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你带走了她 她在哪 罗伯特？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you took her away, where is she Robert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.22,1:32:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样做对你没有好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is no good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.91,1:32:01.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你把她带到这儿来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And brought her here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.71,1:32:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 她在哪儿？- 这样做对你没好处 该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Where is she? - It's no good damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.54,1:32:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 上帝啊 这有什么要紧吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh God, what does it matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.66,1:32:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杀害你第一任妻子的凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did the murderer of your first wife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.82,1:32:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么逃走了 罗伯特？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}escape Robert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.50,1:32:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那凶手为什么逃走了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did the murderer of your first wife escape?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.01,1:32:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}逃到哪里去了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.04,1:32:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在这儿是不是有个仆人 罗伯特？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you have a servant here Robert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.99,1:32:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是不是叫托马斯弗鲁特？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is his name Thomas Floutier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.69,1:32:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}住口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.95,1:32:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你以为你能干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you think you could do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.05,1:32:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For God's sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.76,1:32:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我… 当我让你走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When...when I let you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.82,1:32:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}海蒂 海蒂 我做的一切都是为了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hettie, Hettie what I did I did for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.34,1:32:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有了你 世界都改变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With you the world changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.68,1:32:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}海蒂 海蒂 你一定要相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hettie, Hettie you must believe me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.61,1:32:55.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说你相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}say you believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.28,1:32:57.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绝不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.30,1:33:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绝不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.99,1:33:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}死也不说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not this side of hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.14,1:33:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.93,1:33:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.73,1:33:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.83,1:33:25.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.13,1:33:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.59,1:33:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这儿替我干活的 是弗鲁特没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's Floutier the man who works for me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.85,1:33:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了别的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Amongst other things{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.96,1:33:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他还照料海伦娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he looks after the needs of Lady Helena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.90,1:33:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的固执\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It may give you some satisfaction to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.70,1:33:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将会让她送命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that your stubbornness will be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.06,1:33:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这下你满意了吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the inevitable cause of her death now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.51,1:33:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然还有你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yours too of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.70,1:33:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗鲁特将会替你安排一起事故\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Floutier will arrange an accident for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.84,1:33:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的钱都会是我的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Money will revert to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.45,1:34:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}适当地哀悼上一阵子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And after a suitable period of morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.99,1:34:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就会离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.84,1:34:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你以为我爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you think Pa would{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.36,1:34:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会就这么让你带着我的钱离开吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Iet you just walk off with my money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.86,1:34:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法律是不容争议的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can't argue with the law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.00,1:34:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是我的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.73,1:34:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.62,1:34:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.83,1:34:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得在教堂里 我出了什么事呢 罗伯特？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you think happened to me in the church Robert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.49,1:34:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我把花束掉在地上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When I dropped my bouquet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.39,1:34:41.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是因为我当时看见了我的丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I saw the man I married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.14,1:34:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个鬼魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A ghost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.64,1:34:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以为他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought he was dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.50,1:34:53.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}知道我去了哪儿吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But that's where I've been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.58,1:34:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我和我的丈夫在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With my husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.71,1:35:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.88,1:36:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}空荡荡的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Empty rooms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.96,1:37:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有那气味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The scent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.42,1:37:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯弗鲁特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thomas Floutier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.80,1:38:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 照顾她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson take care of her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.84,1:43:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我经过了怎样的等待啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How I've waited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.05,1:43:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在黑暗里 哭啊哭啊 就为这一刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How I've cried again and again in the darkness for this moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.57,1:43:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.80,1:43:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.92,1:44:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.96,1:44:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你妹妹艾格尼丝派来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Emissaries of your sister Agnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.12,1:44:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.15,1:44:15.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是怎么做到的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}how did you do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.24,1:44:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我花了漫长的7年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I spent 7 long years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.97,1:44:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把这小教堂搞得摇摇欲坠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}insuring the chapel's utter instability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.41,1:44:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我试过逃跑 但没有一次成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Any attempt I made to escape was thwarted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.22,1:44:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于是我改建了这个入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so I recreated the entrance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.81,1:44:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一砖块一块砖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}brick by brick,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.15,1:44:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一根木头一根木头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}timber by timber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.05,1:44:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我科学地利用了结构的不稳定性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I made a science of instability{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.04,1:44:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I succeeded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.00,1:44:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}7年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}7 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.89,1:45:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我的办案中 这是独一无二的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was unique in my experience{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.62,1:45:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先伏法 后犯罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to serve a sentence before committing the crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.77,1:45:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}护士？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nurse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.77,1:45:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们就是这样发现了 格洛文真正的女主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And so it was that we discovered the true Mistress of Glovin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.00,1:45:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个毫不疯癫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A woman so far from madness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.05,1:45:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因而得以幸存于如此… 不…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who had survived so...no...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.64,1:45:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她如此成功地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who had so triumphantly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.60,1:45:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在7年的禁锢后幸存下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}triumphantly survived 7 years of captivity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.48,1:45:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以至于福尔摩斯很乐意把她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that Holmes was pleased to call her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.99,1:45:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}称之为他所见到过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}one of the finest minds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.54,1:45:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最聪明的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he had ever encountered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.19,1:45:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遇到了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In meeting her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.92,1:45:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想福尔摩斯也就揭开了 他那些梦的谜团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe Holmes solved the riddle of his dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.64,1:45:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在唯一让他困扰的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It only troubles him now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.07,1:45:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他无法否认 可能梦也具有预言性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in so far as he cannot deny the possibility that it was prophetic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.15,1:45:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}格洛文的新主人并非别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The new owner of Glovin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.41,1:45:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而正是海伦娜 圣西蒙女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was none other than Lady Helena St. Simon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.05,1:45:55.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}海伦娜女士明智地决定要把它卖掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Helena wisely decided to sell it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.59,1:45:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并且赎回用它作抵押的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and redeem the mortgages upon it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.38,1:46:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正因为有了莫尔顿一家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot conceive of a happier prospect{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.58,1:46:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有他们家庭的幸福未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than to imagine Glovin restored{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.94,1:46:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}使得格洛文恢复了生机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for the enjoyment of the Moulton's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.36,1:46:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无法想象比这更好的前景了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and their future family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.67,1:46:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你竟敢…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How dare you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.22,1:46:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你竟敢记录这件案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How dare you make a record of this case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.35,1:46:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}记录… 不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rec...no, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.48,1:46:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只不过是在回复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm merely answering an invitation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.54,1:46:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另一个研讨会的请柬罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to another seminar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.67,1:46:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.62,1:46:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那快点 我们一小时后要动身了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well be quick, we leave in an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.46,1:46:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}干嘛去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.46,1:46:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 当然是看演出了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For heavens sake what's in the performance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.13,1:46:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}(谢谢)
